ing o\'zgarishini tasdiqlaganingiz uchun tashakkur. Yakuniy tasdiqlash uchun %s manziliga hozirgina xat yuborildi.','Change Ownership'=>'Egarlik huquqini o\'zgartirish','Change Plan'=>'Tarifni o‘zgartirish','Change User'=>'Foydalanuvchini oʻzgartirish','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Foydalanuvchini o\'zgartirish orqali siz hisob egaligini quyidagiga o\'tkazishga rozilik bildirasiz:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'O‘zgarishlar tarixi','Changing user, please wait'=>'Foydalanuvchi oʻzgartirilmoqda, iltimos kuting','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Agar xatni olmagan bo\'lsangiz, spam papkasini tekshirib ko\'ring yoki %4$s tomonidan yuborilgan xatlarni qidiring.','Checkout'=>'Rasmiylashtirish','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Litsenziyani faollashtirish uchun %s tagacha saytni tanlang.','City'=>'Shahar','Clear API Cache'=>'API keshini tozalash','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Yangilanish vaqtinchalik ma\'lumotlarini tozalash','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Bu yerni bosing','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Plagindan anonim ravishda foydalanish uchun bu yerni bosing','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'%s ball qo\'yilgan sharhlarni ko\'rish uchun bosing','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s – mijozimning elektron pochta manzili','Code'=>'Kod','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Mijoz yangi litsenziya sotib olganda %s komissiya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Potensial qaytarishlar uchun 30 kunni saqlab qolganimiz sababli, biz faqat 30 kundan oshgan komissiyalarni to\'laymiz.','Communication'=>'Aloqa','Compatible up to'=>'Quyidagicha mos keladi','complete the opt-in'=>'obunani yakunlash','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Tabriklaymiz','Never miss an important update'=>'Muhim yangilanishni hech qachon o\'tkazib yubormang','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'%1$s v%2$s ga yangilaganingiz uchun tashakkur!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiyalar yangilanishlari, o‘quv qo‘llanmalari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo‘yicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti ma\'lumotlarini ulashish uchun ro‘yxatdan o‘ting. Bu bizga %s ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq qilishga va sizga kerakli vazifalarni yanada yaxshiroq bajarishiga yordam beradi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, oʻquv materiallari hamda vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar boʻyicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti haqida baʼzi maʼlumotlarni ulashish uchun roʻyxatdan oʻting.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Buni o\'tkazib yuborsangiz ham muammo yo\'q! %1$s baribir yaxshi ishlayveradi.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Muhim yangilanishni o‘tkazib yubormasligingiz va %s ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq hamda siz xohlagan vazifalarni bajarishda samaraliroq qilishimizga yordam berish uchun ushbu ixtiyoriy funksiyani joriy qildik.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Freemius tarmoq darajasidagi integratsiyasini taqdim etishdan mamnunmiz.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida tarmoqda hali e\'tiboringizni talab qiladigan %s ta sayt aniqlandi.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida litsenziyasi faollashtirilishi kutilayotgan %d ta sayt aniqlandi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Agar siz ushbu saytlarda %s dan foydalanishni istasangiz, iltimos, litsenziya kalitingizni quyiga kiriting va faollashtirish tugmasini bosing.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Shuningdek, buni hozircha oʻtkazib yuborishingiz va litsenziyani keyinroq %s tarmogʻi darajasidagi Hisob qaydnomasi sahifasida faollashtirishingiz mumkin.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ulentgan','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Tugatganingizdan so\'ng, %s ni o\'chiring va uni qayta yoqing.','Contact'=>'Aloqa','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksional yangilanishlar, o\'quv materiallari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar yuzasidan siz bilan bog\'lanishimizni istasangiz, iltimos, bizga xabar bering:','Contact Support'=>'Yordam xizmati bilan bog\'lanish','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Noqulaylik uchun uzr so\'raymiz va agar bizga imkon bersangiz, yordam berishga tayyormiz.','Contact Us'=>'Biz bilan bog‘laning','Please contact us here'=>'Biz bilan shu yerda bog\'laning','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Iltimos, quyidagi xabar bilan biz bilan bog\'laning:','Continue'=>'Davom etish','Contributors'=>'Ishtirokchilar','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'%s ni faollashtirib bo‘lmadi.','Country'=>'Mamlakat','Cron Type'=>'Cron turi','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box.