'=>'Funksiya','Included'=>'Kiritilgan','Not included'=>'Kiritilmagan','Your licence'=>'Sizning litsenziyangiz','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%2$d tadan %1$d tasi foydalanilmoqda','Renews'=>'Yangilanadi','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Saytning sinov, test va lokal nusxalari bepul bo‘lib, hech qachon sayt limiti hisobiga kirmaydi.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Sizning rejangiz ustuvor qo\'llab-quvvatlashni o\'z ichiga oladi.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Litsenziyangiz va hisob-kitobingizni boshqaring','Get more with Pro'=>'Pro bilan ko\'proq oling','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Karta talab qilinmaydigan %d kunlik bepul sinov muddatini boshlang' . "\0" . 'Karta talab qilinmaydigan %d kunlik bepul sinov muddatini boshlang','See plans and prices'=>'Reja va narxlarni ko\'rish','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Tranzly va Page Builder Sandwich’ni birgalikda ishlatmoqchimisiz? To‘plam ikkala Pro plaginni ham arzonroq narxda o‘z ichiga oladi.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugadi. Yangilanishlar va Pro funksiyalarini olishda davom etish uchun uni yangilang.','Renew now'=>'Hozir yangilash','Compare the plans'=>'Rejalarni solishtirish','Search features'=>'Funksiyalarni qidirish','Area'=>'Hudud','Included in'=>'Quyidagilar kiritilgan:','No feature matches.'=>'Hech qanday funksiya mos kelmadi.','Features by plan'=>'Tarif bo\'yicha imkoniyatlar','Hide'=>'Yashirish','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Plaginlar ekranida uni faollashtiring','Install it'=>'Uni oʻrnatish','Overview'=>'Umumiy koʻrinish','Setup'=>'O‘rnatish','Plans and licence'=>'Rejalar va litsenziya','Add-ons'=>'Qo‘shimchalar','Get help'=>'Yordam olish','Feedback'=>'Fikr-mulohaza','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Tanlovingiz saqlanmadi.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'O\'rnatish holatini saqlab bo\'lmadi.','Match my computer'=>'Kompyuterim bilan moslashtirish','Light'=>'Yorugʻ','Dark'=>'To\'q rang','Colour scheme'=>'Rang sxemasi','Help'=>'Yordam','Guide to this screen'=>'Ushbu ekran bo\'yicha qo\'llanma','Take the tour'=>'Ekskursiyadan o‘tish','Get help or report a bug'=>'Yordam olish yoki xatolik haqida xabar berish','Plugin screens'=>'Plagin ekranlari','That could not be saved.'=>'Uni saqlab bo\'lmadi.','Before you contact support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qilishdan oldin','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'So\'rovingiz ushbu saytdan ushbu plaginni yaratuvchi %s ga yuborildi. Biz yuboramiz:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'javob bera olishimiz uchun elektron pochta manzilingiz va ismingiz;','the subject and message you write;'=>'siz yozgan mavzu va xabar;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'sizning litsenziyangiz raqami, shuning uchun to‘lov qilgan mijozlar ustuvorlikka ega bo‘ladi;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'faqat uni belgilasangiz: sayt tafsilotlari (WordPress va PHP versiyalari, tema, plaginlar, parollar va elektron pochta manzillari olib tashlangan xatoliklar jurnali parchasi), uni yuborishdan oldin o‘qib chiqishingiz mumkin;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'faqat ularni qo\'shsangiz: saytingiz uchun loginlar, shifrlangan holda saqlanadi va so\'rovingiz yopilgandan keyin 30 kun o\'tgach o\'chiriladi.','Privacy policy'=>'Maxfiylik siyosati','I agree, continue'=>'Roziman, davom etish','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Ulanishni tekshirib bo‘lmadi.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Bu ishlamadi. Qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® yordam xizmati ushbu saytni uzib qo‘ydi.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati bu saytni endi tan olmaydi.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Siz bu saytni uzdingiz.','Connect this site to support'=>'Ushbu saytni qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulang','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Ulandi. Javoblar %s ga yuboriladi.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Ulanmagan. Quyida elektron pochta manzilingiz bilan soʻrov yuborishingiz mumkin; ulanish uni har safar kiritishdan saqlaydi.','E-mail address'=>'Elektron pochta manzili','Your name (optional)'=>'Ismingiz (ixtiyoriy)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Men ushbu saytni Zinn Digital® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulashga roziman. U ushbu sayt manzilini, WordPress va PHP versiyalarini hamda plagin versiyasini yuboradi va uni istalgan vaqtda yerdan yoki Zinn Digital® orqali uzib qo‘yish mumkin.','Connect'=>'Ulashish','I need help'=>'Yordam kerak','Report a bug'=>'Xatolik haqida xabar berish','Send feedback'=>'Fikr-mulohaza yuborish','Request a feature'=>'Funksiya so\'rash','The site details could not be read.'=>'Sayt tafsilotlarini o‘qib bo‘lmadi.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Soʻrovingizni yuborib boʻlmadi. Bir necha daqiqadan soʻng yana urinib koʻring.','WordPress admin'=>'WordPress administratori','File manager'=>'Fayl menejeri','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Fikr-mulohaza va funksiya so‘rovlari','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'Yuborildi. Sizning ma\'lumotnomangiz %s, va bizning javobimiz elektron pochta orqali keladi.','What is it about?'=>'Bu nima haqida?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'(Elektron pochtaga) javob berish','Subject'=>'Mavzu','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Nima qildingiz, nimani kutgansiz va buning o\'rniga nima sodir bo\'ldi?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Sayt tafsilotlarini qo‘shish (versiyalar, mavzu, plaginlar, xatoliklar jurnali parchasi)','See exactly what is sent'=>'An aniq nima yuborilganini ko\'ring','Loading…'=>'Yuklanmoqda…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash uchun kirish ma\'lumotlari (ixtiyoriy, shifrlangan holda saqlanadi)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Kirish maʼlumotlari faqat paroli bilan birga yuboriladi. Qatorni chala toʻldirgandan koʻra, uni boʻsh qoldiring.','Login address'=>'Kirish manzili','Username'=>'Foydalanuvchi nomi','Password'=>'Parol','Add a login'=>'Kirish qo\'shish','Create a temporary support login'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo\'llab-quvvatlash loginini yaratish','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash jamoamiz uchun alohida foydalanuvchi, foydalanuvchilarga kirish huquqi, plaginlarni o\'rnatish yoki kodni tahrirlash imkoniyatisiz. U muddati tugaganda yoki uni quyida istalgan vaqtda bekor qilganingizda avtomatik ravishda o\'chiriladi.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Ha, %d kun davomida' . "\0" . 'Ha, %d kun davomida','Send'=>'Yuborish','The list could not be loaded.'=>'Ro\'yxatni yuklab bo\'lmadi.','That login could not be removed.'=>'Ushbu kirish ma\'lumotlarini o\'chirib bo\'lmadi.','Temporary support logins'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo‘llab-quvvatlash uchun kirishlar','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Hech qanday. Qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati bu yerda kirish ma’lumotlarini yaratmasangiz, ushbu saytga kira olmaydi.','expired, being removed'=>'muddati o\'tgan, o\'chirilmoqda','expires %s'=>'%s muddati tugaydi','Revoke now'=>'Hozir bekor qilish','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'%2$d qadamdan %1$d-qadam','Close the tour'=>'Turnni yopish','Back'=>'Orqaga','Everything in one place'=>'Barchasi bir joyda','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Ushbu tablar plaginning har bir ekraniga olib boradi: o\'rnatish, sozlamalar, litsenziyangiz, yordam va boshqalar.','Help on every screen'=>'Har bir ekranda yordam','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Hozirgi ekranningiz boʻyicha qoʻllanma, ushbu tanishuv ekskursiyasi yoki bizdan yordam soʻrash uchun ushbu menyuni oching.','Light or dark'=>'Yorug\' yoki qorong\'i','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Yorugʻ, qorongʻi yoki kompyuteringiz sozlamasiga mos rejimni tanlang. Tanlovingiz faqat siz uchun eslab qolinadi.','Welcome'=>'Xush kelibsiz','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Ushbu qisqa ekskursiya narsalar qayerda joylashganini ko‘rsatadi. Uni istalgan vaqtda Escape yordamida tark etishingiz mumkin.','Your site at a glance'=>'Bir qarashda sizning saytingiz','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'O\'rnatish jarayoni va sizning rejangiz bu yerda keyingi bajarilishi kerak bo\'lgan muhim qadam bilan birga ko\'rsatiladi.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Sizning rejangiz, u nechta saytni qamrab olishi va saytning ushbu nusxasi shu limitga kirish yoki kirmasligi.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Pro versiyasini sinab ko\'ring yoki yangilang','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Karta talab qilinmaydigan bepul sinov muddatini boshlang, uni yangilang yoki uzaytiring – barchasi shu yerda.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Har bir funksiya va uni o\'z ichiga olgan reja. Funksiyani qidiring yoki bir vaqtning o\'zida bitta hududni ko\'rsating.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital® haqida qo‘shimcha ma’lumot','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Ushbu plagin bilan ishlaydigan plaginlar va ayni jamoaning xizmatlari. Boshqa ekranlarda yashirgan kartochkalaringizni shu yerda qaytadan ko\'rsatish mumkin.','Connect for faster help'=>'Tezkor yordam uchun ulanish','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Ulanish ixtiyoriy. Bu har safar elektron pochtangizni kiritmasdan so‘rovlar yuborish imkonini beradi va xohlagan vaqtda uzib qo‘yishingiz mumkin.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Yordam so\'rash yoki xato haqida xabar berish','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Nima sodir bo\'lganini tasvirlang. Sayt ma\'lumotlarini qo\'shish yoki qo\'shmaslikni o\'zingiz tanlaysiz va avval uning ichida nima borligini aniq ko\'rishingiz mumkin.','Temporary support access'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo‘llab-quvvatlash ruxsati','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Agar qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati saytingiz ichini ko‘rishi kerak bo‘lsa, bu yerda vaqtinchalik kirish ma’lumotlarini yarating. U muddati tugagach o‘zini o‘chirib tashlaydi va uni istalgan vaqtda o‘chirib tashlashingiz mumkin.','Tell us what to build'=>'Nima qurishimiz kerakligini ayting','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'G‘oya, funksiya so‘rovi yoki har qanday fikr-mulohazani yuboring. U to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri jamoaga borib tushadi.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Bu bir necha daqiqa vaqt oladi va %s ni ushbu saytda darhol ishlaydigan qilib sozlaydi. Keyinchalik hamma narsani o\'zgartirishingiz mumkin.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Siz tayyorsiz. Agar biron narsa kutilganidek ishlamasa, biz birgina tugma bosish masofasidamiz.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'%1$d-qadam (%2$d tadan): %3$s','Finish'=>'Tugatish','Skip setup'=>'O‘rnatishni o‘tkazib yuborish','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Zinn Digital® Ltd kompaniyasi bosh direktori Neil Lock tomonidan yaratilgan','Version %s'=>'Versiya %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Page Builder Sandwich veb-sayti','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Zinn Digital® veb-sayti','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Pro rejalar va narxlarni ko\'rish','Front-end output'=>'Old tomon chiqishi','Class name prefix'=>'Sinf nomi prefiksi','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Plagin sahifalaringizda chop etadigan har bir klass nomi ushbu prefiks bilan boshlanadi, shuning uchun sahifalar qaysi plagin tomonidan yaratilganini oshkor qilmaydi. Harf bilan boshlanadigan 1 dan 8 gacha kichik harflar yoki raqamlar.','Save'=>'Saqlash','Beta updates'=>'Beta yangilanishlar','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Ushbu sayt yangilanish sifatida beta-versiyalarni qabul qiladi.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Bu saytga faqat barqaror versiyalar qabul qilinadi.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Buni Hisob sahifasida o\'zgartiring','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Beta versiyalar o\'z hisobiga ulangan litsenziyaga ega Pro o\'rnatishlariga taqdim etiladi. Ulangandan so\'ng, Hisob sahifasidan qo\'shilishingiz mumkin.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'Chegaralar saqlandi. Sahifalar keyingi ko\'rishda yangi kengliklarni qabul qiladi.','Breakpoints'=>'Nuqtalar','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Planshet uchun o‘rnatilgan uslublar planshet kengligigacha, mobil qurilma uchun o‘rnatilganlari esa mobil qurilma kengligigacha amal qiladi. Ish stoli uslublari qolgan barcha joylarda qo‘llaniladi.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Planshet: gacha (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Mobil: (px) gacha','Save breakpoints'=>'Tozalash nuqtalarini saqlash','Use the default widths'=>'Standart kengliklardan foydalanish','Settings'=>'Sozlamalar','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Ushbu postni o‘zgartirish so‘rovi yakunlanmasdan to‘xtatildi, shuning uchun post tashlab yuborildi. Uni o‘zgartirish uchun oching yoki bu yerdan qaytadan o‘zgartiring.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Tiklash uchun ushbu postning zaxira nusxasi mavjud emas.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Konvertatsiya qilingan tarkibni saqlab bo‘lmadi.','Unknown error.'=>'Noma\'lum xatolik.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Hali hech qanday eski kontent tekshirilmadi.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Eski kontent tiklanmoqda: %1$d / %2$d ta xabar.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Eski kontentni o\'tkazish: %1$d / %2$d ta post.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Bekor qilish yakunlandi: %1$d ta tiklandi, %2$d ta bajarilmadi.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'O‘tkazish yakunlandi: %1$d tasi o‘tkazildi, %2$d tasi o‘zgarishsiz qoldi, %3$d tasi bajarilmadi.','Legacy content'=>'Eski kontent','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Oldingi Page Builder Sandwich versiyalari yordamida yaratilgan sahifalar fonda bloklarga aylantiriladi. Har bir post avval zaxiralanadi, shuning uchun har bir aylantirishni bekor qilish mumkin.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'%d ta post hali ham eski tarkibni saqlab turibdi.' . "\0" . '%d ta post hali ham eski tarkibni saqlamoqda.','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d ta xabar zaxira nusxasiga ega.' . "\0" . '%d ta postning zaxira nusxasi mavjud.','%d post could not be handled'=>'%d ta xabarni qayta ishlab bo‘lmadi' . "\0" . '%d ta xabarni qayta ishlab bo‘lmadi','Post %d'=>'%d-xabar','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Konvertatsiya boshlandi. U fonda davom etmoqda; bu sahifani tark etishingiz mumkin.','Convert legacy content'=>'Eski tarkibni oʻtkazish','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'O‘tkazilgan har bir xabarni eski kontentiga tiklaysizmi? Ushbu xabarlar o‘tkazilganidan keyin kiritilgan o‘zgarishlar yo‘qoladi.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Bekor qilish boshlandi. U fonda davom etmoqda; bu sahifadan chiqib ketishingiz mumkin.','Undo all conversions'=>'Barcha o\'zgarishlarni bekor qilish','Alert'=>'Ogohlantirish','Information'=>'Ma\'lumot','Success'=>'Muvaffaqiyat','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Ogohlantirishlar va xatolar ekran oʻquvchi foydalanuvchilariga darhol yetkaziladi; maʼlumot va muvaffaqiyat xabarlari esa ular oʻz ishini tugatgach oʻqib eshittiriladi.','Show icon'=>'Belgini ko\'rsatish','Visitors can close it'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar uni yopishi mumkin','Title (optional)'=>'Sarlavha (ixtiyoriy)','Write the message…'=>'Xabarni yozing…','section — a thematic section'=>'boʻlim — tematik boʻlim','div — no meaning'=>'div — ma\'nosiz','header — introductory content'=>'sarlavha — kirish mazmuni','footer — closing content'=>'pastki qism — yakunlovchi kontent','article — self-contained content'=>'maqola — mustaqil tarkib','aside — related content'=>'chetda — tegishli tarkib','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'asosiy — asosiy kontent (sahifasiga bir marta)','nav — navigation links'=>'nav — navigatsiya havolalari','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'Stek (flexbox, ustun)','Row (flexbox)'=>'Qator (flexbox)','Grid'=>'Setka','Layout'=>'Maket','Editing: %s'=>'Tahrirlanmoqda: %s','Lay out children as'=>'Quyi darajadagilarni tartibga solish','Inherited (%s)'=>'Meros qilib olingan (%s)','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Stacked blocks'=>'Ustma-ust qoʻyilgan bloklar','Columns'=>'Ustunlar','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'Kanvasga sudrab olib keling yoki yozing','Content width'=>'Kontent kengligi','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'Qutiga olingan (mavzuning kontent kengligi)','Full width'=>'To\'liq kenglik','Minimum height'=>'Minimal balandlik','HTML tag'=>'HTML tegi','Link'=>'Havola','Make the whole block a link to'=>'Butun blokni havolaga aylantirish','Link text for screen readers'=>'Ekran o\'quvchilari uchun havola matni','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'Blokni ko‘ra olmaydigan tashrif buyuruvchilar uchun havola nima qilishi.','Open in a new tab'=>'Yangi oynada ochish','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'Bog\'langan blok ichiga havolalar yoki tugmalarni qo\'ymang: havola ichidagi havola brauzerlarda ishlamaydi.','Drag to resize these columns'=>'Ushbu ustunlar hajmini o\'zgartirish uchun sudrang','Drag to resize this row'=>'Ushbu qator hajmini o‘zgartirish uchun sudrang','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'Ushbu blok qancha ustun va qatorni egallashini belgilash uchun katakchalar bo‘ylab suring','+ Column'=>'+ Ustun','− Column'=>'− Ustu