ass "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'"%s" sinfini o\'chirishni xohlaysizmi? Undan foydalanadigan elementlar o\'z kontentini saqlab qoladi, lekin uslublarini yo\'qotadi.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Faqat filtrlashdan oʻtmagan HTML qoʻshish huquqiga ega boʻlgan foydalanuvchilaragina maxsus CSS\'ni oʻzgartira oladi.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Ushbu CSS\'ning ayrim qismlari ishlatilmaydi: xavfsizlik maqsadida @import, expression(), javascript: URL\'lari, "<" va muvozanatsiz qavslar olib tashlanadi.','Upload a font'=>'Shriftni yuklash','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Shriftlarni yuklash uchun WordPress 6.5 yoki undan keyingi versiyasi talab qilinadi.','Font name'=>'Shrift nomi','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'masalan: Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s yuklandi va foydalanishga tayyor.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Shrift faylini tanlang (%s)','Font library'=>'Shriftlar kutubxonasi','%d files'=>'%d ta fayl','Font switched off for the site.'=>'Sayt uchun shrift o\'chirilgan.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'Sayt uchun shrift yoqildi.','Switch off'=>'O‘chirish','Switch on'=>'Yoqish','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Adobe Fonts veb-loyihangizning kit ID raqamini kiriting. Shundan so\'ng uning shriftlari sahifalaringizga Adobe\'dan yuklanadi.','Your web projects'=>'Sizning veb-loyihalaringiz','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'Adobe Fonts ullandi.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'Adobe Fonts uzluki uzildi.','Kit id'=>'To\'plam identifikatori','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" uchun qorong‘i qiymat yaroqli rang emas.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Mehmon tanlamaganda','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchining qurilmasiga ergashish','Dark colours'=>'To\'q ranglar','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Har bir rang uchun qorong‘i versiyasini ko‘rsating. Bo‘sh qoldirilgan ranglar ikkala rejimda ham o‘zgarmasdan qoladi. Qorong‘i rejim kamida bitta rang uchun qorong‘i qiymat kiritilganda yoqiladi.','Dark version of %s'=>'%s ning qorong‘i versiyasi','Dark mode saved.'=>'Qora rejim saqlandi.','Page CSS'=>'Sahifa CSS','Global classes'=>'Global klasslar','Classes'=>'Sinflar','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Sayt dizaynida sinflar yarating, so\'ngra ularni shu yerga qo\'shing.','Custom CSS'=>'Maxsus CSS','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Ushbu element uchun qoidalar yozing. "selector" ushbu elementni bildiradi, masalan, selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — oddiy e\'lonlar elementining o\'ziga nisbatan qo\'llaniladi.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Shrift fayllari %s bo\'lishi kerak.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Bu shrift fayli bo\'sh yoki hajmi 10 MB dan katta.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Bir marta uslub bering, hamma joyda qayta foydalaning, bir joyda o\'zgartiring.','Variables'=>'O\'zgaruvchilar','Named values any element can use.'=>'Har qanday element foydalanishi mumkin bo\'lgan nomlangan qiymatlar.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Oraliq masofa, radius va soyalar','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Har bir oraliq, burchak va soyani tanlash vositasi taqdim etadigan masshtablar.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Buni xohlaydigan tashrif buyuruvchilar uchun ranglaringizning qorong‘i versiyasi.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt va shablonlar tomonidan ishlatiladigan logotip, ranglar, shriftlar va ohang.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'O\'z shriftlaringizni yuklang yoki Adobe Fonts\'ni ulang.','CSS for this page only.'=>'Faqat ushbu sahifa uchun CSS.','CSS for this page'=>'Ushbu sahifa uchun CSS','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'Faqat ushbu sahifada, sayt uslublaridan keyin yuklanadi. Sahifa bilan birga saqlanadi.','Short name'=>'Qisqa nom','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'"%s" qisqa nomi ikki marta ishlatilgan.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": qisqa nomlarda kichik harflar, raqamlar va defislardan foydalaniladi.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'"%s" qiymati ushbu sozlama tomonidan qabul qilinmaydi.','Radius'=>'Radius','Add a step'=>'Qadam qo\'shish','Scales saved.'=>'Masshtablar saqlandi.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'Masshtablar odatiy qiymatlarga qaytarildi.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Standart masshtablarga tiklash','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Hozircha o\'zgaruvchilar yo\'q. O\'zgaruvchi bitta qiymatni — kenglik, ranglar aralashmasi, shrift o\'lchamini — ko\'plab elementlar bo\'lishadigan qiymatni saqlaydi.','Add variable'=>'O\'zgaruvchi qo\'shish','Variables saved.'=>'O\'zgaruvchilar saqlandi.','No colours yet.'=>'Hozircha ranglar yo\'q.','Colour %d'=>'Rang %d','Add colour'=>'Rang qo‘shish','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Ikki rang bir xil nomga ega. Bittasining nomini o\'zgartiring.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" yaroqli rang emas.','Theme colours'=>'Mavzu ranglari','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Mavzungizning palitrasi. Bu yerdagi o‘zgarish Sayt muharriri uni qanday saqlasa, xuddi shunday tarzda saytingizning rang versiyasi sifatida saqlanadi va rang ishlatilgan barcha joylarga tatbiq etiladi.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Mavzu ranglari o‘zining asl qiymatlariga qaytarildi.','Reset theme colours'=>'Mavzu ranglarini asl holatiga qaytarish','Your colours'=>'Sizning ranglaringiz','Colours saved.'=>'Rangлар сақланди.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'%s uchun rang tanlang','Clear'=>'Tozalash','The change could not be saved.'=>'Oʻzgarishni saqlab boʻlmadi.','Close panel'=>'Panelni yopish','Theme default'=>'Mavzu standart holda','Theme fonts'=>'Mavzu shriftlari','Your fonts'=>'Sizning shriftlaringiz','Font stack'=>'Shriftlar steklari','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Yuklangan shrift: uning fayllari shriftlar kutubxonasidan olingan.','System sans-serif'=>'Tizimli sans-serif','Add font stack'=>'Shriftlar stekini qo‘shish','Fonts saved.'=>'Shriftlar saqlandi.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'Mavzuingiz va Sayt muharriri bilan umumiy foydalanishda.','Fonts'=>'Shriftlar','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Butun sayt uchun sarlavha va asosiy matn shriftlari.','Back to Site design'=>'Sayt dizayniga qaytish','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Klasslar, tokenlar, qorong‘i rejim, brend to‘plami va maxsus shriftlar Pro versiyasida taqdim etiladi','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Sayt muharririning uslublarini ochish','Heading'=>'Sarlavha','Plain'=>'Oddiy','Accent'=>'Aksent','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Almashtirish uchun tillar mavjud emas. Almashtirgich tarjima plagini ikkita yoki undan ortiq tilni ko‘rsatganda paydo bo‘ladi.','Switcher'=>'O‘tkazgich','Show the current language'=>'Joriy tilni ko\'rsatish','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Tranzly\'ni o\'rnating va ikki yoki undan ortiq tilni qo\'shing, shundan so\'ng almashtirgich shu yerda paydo bo\'ladi.','List'=>'Ro\'yxat','Pills'=>'Kapsulalar','Buttons'=>'Tugmalar','Dropdown'=>'Ochiluvchi ro‘yxat','Language codes'=>'Til kodlari','Show each language as'=>'Har bir tilni quyidagicha ko\'rsatish:','Language name'=>'Til nomi','Language code'=>'Til kodi','Name and code'=>'Nomi va kodi','Flags'=>'Bayroqchalar','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Standart bo\'yicha o\'chirilgan: bayroq bu til emas, balki mamlakat.','Include the current language'=>'Joriy tilni kiritish','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Ushbu sahifa tarjima qilinmagan tillarni yashirish','Stack vertically'=>'Vertikal ravishda joylashtirish','Background'=>'Fon','Current language text'=>'Joriy til matni','Current language background'=>'Joriy til fonlari','Size and spacing'=>'Hajmi va oraligʻi','Space between languages'=>'Tillalar orasidagi bo\'shliq','Text size'=>'Matn hajmi','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s shuningdek ushbu sahifani tahrirlamoqda. Saqlash ularning o\'zgarishlarini ustiga yozib yuborishi mumkin.','Block library'=>'Bloklar kutubxonasi','Layers'=>'Qatlamlar','Page canvas'=>'Sahifa kanvasi','Revisions'=>'Tahrirlar','Block settings'=>'Blok sozlamalari','Add block: %s'=>'Blok qo\'shish: %s','(no title)'=>'(sarlavhasiz)','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Studio\'da ochish: %s','Undo'=>'Bekor qilish','Redo'=>'Qayta bajarish','Show or hide layers'=>'Qatlamlarni ko\'rsatish yoki yashirish','Show or hide the block library'=>'Blok kutubxonasini ko\'rsatish yoki yashirish','Show revisions'=>'Tahrirlarni ko\'rsatish','Open the normal editor'=>'Oddiy muharrirni ochish','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Klaviatura yorliqlari','Preview: desktop'=>'Oldindan koʻrish: kompyuter','Preview: tablet'=>'Ko‘rish: planshet','Preview: mobile'=>'Koʻrish: mobil','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Tanlangan blok uslubidan nusxalash','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Tanlangan blokga uslubni joylashtirish','Copy the selected section'=>'Tanlangan qismdan nusxa olish','Paste a copied section'=>'Nusxalangan boʻlimni qoʻyish','Turn off safe mode'=>'Xavfsiz rejimni o\'chirish','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Xavfsiz rejimni yoqish (boshqa plaginlar o\'chirilgan, siz uchun, faqat Studio\'da)','Published'=>'Nashr etilgan','Scheduled'=>'Rejalashtirilgan','Pending review'=>'Koʻrib chiqilmoqda','Private'=>'Maxfiy','Draft'=>'Qoralama','All changes saved'=>'Barcha oʻzgarishlar saqlandi','Saving…'=>'Saqlanmoqda…','Autosaving…'=>'Avtomatik saqlanmoqda…','Unsaved changes'=>'Saqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar','autosaved'=>'avtomatik saqlangan','Desktop preview'=>'Ish stoli oldindan ko‘rinishi','Tablet preview'=>'Planshet oldindan ko‘rinishi','Mobile preview'=>'Mobil oldindan ko\'rish','%1$s preview (%2$d px)'=>'%1$s oldindan koʻrish (%2$d px)','Studio toolbar'=>'Studio asboblar paneli','Back to the normal editor'=>'Oddiy muharrirga qaytish','Page title'=>'Sahifa sarlavhasi','Preview width'=>'Ko\'rish kengligi','Command palette'=>'Buyruqlar paneli','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Sahifani koʻrish (yangi oynada ochiladi)','Save draft'=>'Qoralamani saqlash','Publish'=>'Nashr qilish','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Saqlanmagan o\'zgarishlarni tiklash kerakmi?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Bu sahifada saqlanmagan o\'zgarishlar mavjud. Ular ushbu brauzerda saqlab qolingan:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Bu sahifaning saqlangan versiyasiga qaraganda yangiroq avtomatik saqlangan nusxasi mavjud:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Saqlanmagan o\'zgarishlarni tiklash','Discard'=>'Bekor qilish','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Tuzatishlarni yuklab boʻlmadi.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'Tahrir tiklandi. Saqlash uchun saqlang yoki orqaga qaytish uchun bekor qiling.','Close revisions'=>'Tahrirlarni yopish','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Hozircha o\'zgartirishlar yo\'q. Har bir saqlash bittasini yaratadi.','Revision from %s'=>'%s dan tahrir','Restore this revision'=>'Ushbu tahrirni tiklash','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'Xavfsiz rejimni o‘zgartirib bo‘lmadi.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim yoqilgan.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'%d ta boshqa plagin siz uchun va faqat Sandwich Studio\'da o\'chirilgan. Jonli sayt va boshqa foydalanuvchilar ta\'sir qilmaydi.' . "\0" . '%d ta boshqa plagin siz uchun va faqat Sandwich Studio’da o‘chirilgan. Asosiy sayt va boshqa foydalanuvchilar ta’sir qilmaydi.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Xavfsiz rejim: Studiodagi boshqa plaginlarni faqat o\'zingiz uchun o\'chirib qo\'ying','Save your changes.'=>'O\'zgarishlarni saqlash.','Undo your last change.'=>'Oxirgi oʻzgarishni bekor qilish.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Oxirgi bekor qilgan amalni qaytadan bajaring.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Qatlamlar panelini ko\'rsatish yoki yashirish.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Ushbu klaviatura yorliqlarini ko\'rsatish.','Select a block first.'=>'Avval blokni tanlang.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'Stil nusxalandi. Uni istalgan blokga, ushbu saytda yoki boshqasida joylang.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Brauzer nusxalashni rad etdi.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'Boʻlim nusxalandi. Uni shu saytdagi yoki boshqa istalgan sahifaga qoʻying.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Almashinuv buferida Sandwich Studio\'dan nusxalangan uslub mavjud emas.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Uslub %d ta blokga qo‘shildi.' . "\0" . '%d ta blokga uslub qo\'shildi.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Bu uslub tanlangan blokga mos kelmaydi.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Veb-sahifaga nusxa ko‘chirilmagan.','Section pasted.'=>'Boʻlim qoʻyildi.','Paste style'=>'Uslubni joylash','Paste section'=>'Bo‘limni qo‘yish','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Joylab qo‘yish uchun bu yerda Ctrl+V (Mac\'da Cmd+V) tugmalarini bosing','Copy style'=>'Uslubdan nusxalash','Copy section'=>'Bo‘limdan nusxa olish','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio\'da tahrirlash','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'Saqlash amalga oshmadi. Internet aloqangizni tekshirib, qayta urinib ko\'ring, o\'zgarishlaringiz ushbu brauzerda saqlanib qoladi.','Published.'=>'Chop etilgan','Saved.'=>'Saqlandi.','Maintenance and pre-launch mode'=>'Texnik xizmat koʻrsatish va ishga tushirishdan oldingi rejim','What visitors see'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar nimani ko‘radi','The site, as normal'=>'Sayt, odatdagidek','Maintenance: a notice, and search engines are told to come back later'=>'Texnik xizmat ko‘rsatish: bildirishnoma va qidiruv tizimlariga keyinroq qaytish buyurildi','Pre-launch: a notice, and search engines are told not to index the site'=>'Ishga tushirishdan oldin: bildirishnoma va qidiruv tizimlariga saytni indekslamaslik buyurilgan','Page to show instead'=>'O\'rniga ko\'rsatiladigan sahifa','Design any page with the builder and choose it here. Without one, visitors see a short notice with the site’s name.'=>'Konstruktor yordamida istalgan sahifani yarating va uni shu yerda tanlang. Agar u bo\'lmasa, tashrif buyuruvchilar sayt nomi ko\'rsatilgan qisqa bildirishnomani ko\'rishadi.','Who still sees the real site (administrators always do):'=>'Haqiqiy saytni kimlar ko\'radi (administratorlar har doim ko\'radi):','Open the site in a private window to see what visitors see.'=>'Saytni tashrif buyuruvchilar nima ko‘rishini ko‘rish uchun uni maxfiy oynada oching.','Network settings saved.'=>'Tarmoq sozlamalari saqlandi.','These settings apply to the %d site in this network.'=>'Ushbu sozlamalar ushbu tarmoqdagi %d ta saytga taalluqlidir.' . "\0" . 'Bu sozlamalar ushbu tarmoqdagi %d ta saytga nisbatan qo\'llaniladi.','Shared templates'=>'Umumiy shablonlar','Patterns saved on the main site that are ticked here appear on every site, under “Network templates”. Each site inserts its own copy.'=>'Asosiy saytda saqlangan va bu yerda belgilangan namunalar "Tarmoq shablonlari" ostida har bir saytda ko‘rinadi. Har bir sayt o‘z nusxasini kiritadi.','The main site has no saved patterns yet.'=>'Asosiy saytda hali saqlangan naqshlar yo\'q.','White label for every site'=>'Har bir sayt uchun White label','Used by every site that has not saved its own white-label settings.'=>'Oʻzining brendsiz (white-label) sozlamalarini saqlamagan har bir sayt tomonidan ishlatiladi.','Turn white label on'=>'Oq yorliqni yoqish','Builder name'=>'Konstruktor nomi','Visual editor name'=>'Vizual muharrir nomi','Author'=>'Muallif','Author website'=>'Muallif veb-sayti','Menu icon'=>'Menyu belgisi','Role defaults for every site'=>'Har bir sayt uchun rol boʻyicha standart qiymatlar','Save network settings'=>'Tarmoq sozlamalarini saqlash','Searching… %d item checked so far.'=>'Qidirilmoqda… Hozirgacha %d ta element tekshirildi.' . "\0" . 'Qidirilmoqda… Hozirgacha %d ta element tekshirildi.','No matches in %d items. Nothing to replace.'=>'%d ta elementda mos keluvchi natijalar topilmadi. Almashtirish uchun hech narsa yo\'q.','%1$d matches on %2$d pages (%3$d items searched). Nothing has changed yet.'=>'%1$d ta mos kelish %2$d ta sahifada topildi (%3$d ta element qidirildi). Hozircha hech narsa oʻzgarmadi.','Replacing… %1$d of %2$d pages done.'=>'Almashtirilmoqda... %1$d / %2$d sahifa bajarildi.','Done: %d page changed. You can undo this.'=>'Bajarildi: %d sahifa o\'zgartirildi. Buni bekor qilishingiz mumkin.' . "\0" . 'Bajarildi: %d sahifa o\'zgartirildi. Buni bekor qilishingiz mumkin.','Undoing…'=>'Bekor qilinmoqda…','Undone: %1$d pages restored. %2$d pages were edited after the replacement and were left as they are.'=>'Bajarilmadi: %1$d sahifa tiklandi. %2$d ta sahifa almashtirilgandan keyin tahrirlangan va o\'z holatida qoldirilgan.','Undone: %d page restored.'=>'Bajarilmadi: %d sahifa tiklandi.' . "\0" . 'Bajarildi: %d ta sahifa tiklandi.','Replace'=>'Almashtirish','Links'=>'Havolalar','Find'=>'Topish','A hex colour such as #1a73e8. Short forms (#fff) match too.'=>'#1a73e8 kabi o\'n oltilik rang. Qisqa shakllar (#fff) ham mos keladi.','Replace with'=>'Bilan almashtirish','Match upper and lower case'=>'Katta va kichik harflarni moslashtirish','Search in'=>'Quyidagidan qidirish','Find matches'=>'Mos keluvchilarni topish','Page'=>'Sahifa','Matches'=>'Mos kelganlar','Replace on %d page'=>'%d-sahifada almashtirish' . "\0" . '%d ta sahifada almashtirish','Undo this replacement'=>'Bu almashtirishni bekor qilish','Review comments'=>'Sharhlarini ko\'rib chiqish','Add a comment'=>'Izoh qoʻshish','Comment %1$d by %2$s: %3$s'=>'%2$s tomonidan %1$d-izoh: %3$s','%d comments on this page.'=>'Ushbu sahifada %d ta izoh mavjud.','Your name'=>'Sizning ismingiz','Your comment'=>'Sizning izohingiz','Send comment'=>'Sharh yuborish','Thank you, your comment was sent.'=>'Rahmat, izohingiz yuborildi.','Click the part of the page your comment is about.'=>'Izohingiz tegishli bo\'lgan sahifa qismini bosing.','Client review'=>'Mijoz sharhi','That part of the page could not be found: it may have been changed or removed since the comment was made.'=>'Sahifaning bu qismi topilmadi: izoh yozilganidan beri u o\'zgartirilgan yoki o\'chirib yuborilgan bo\'lishi mumkin.','Review link'=>'Ko‘rib chiqish havolasi','Let a client comment on this page'=>'Mijozga bu sahifaga izoh qoldirishga ruxsat berish','Anyone with the link can see this page, even before it is published, and leave comments. No account is needed.'=>'Havolaga ega bo\'lgan har bir kishi ushbu sahifani, hatto u e\'lon qilinishidan oldin ham ko\'rishi va izoh qoldirishi mumkin. Hisob qaydnomasi talab qilinmaydi.','Copied'=>'Nusxa olindi','Copy link'=>'Havolani nusxalash','Make a new link (the old one stops working)'=>'Yangi havola yaratish (eskisi ishlamay qoladi)','Comments (%d open)'=>'Sharhlar (%d ta ochiq)' . "\0" . 'Sharhlar (%d ta ochiq)','Show resolved comments'=>'Hal qilingan izohlarni ko\'rsatish','No comments to show.'=>'Ko\'rsatadigan izohlar yo\'q.','Reply'=>'Javob berish','Send reply'=>'Javob yuborish','Show in the editor'=>'Muharrirda ko‘rsatish','Resolve'=>'Hal qilish','Reopen'=>'Qayta ochish','Open Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio-ni ochish','Change styles'=>'Uslublarni o\'zgartirish','Custom CSS and HTML'=>'Maxsus CSS va HTML','Manage templates'=>'Andozalarni boshqarish','Use AI'=>'Sun\'iy intellektni ishlatish','Client mode: text and images only'=>'Mijoz rejimi: faqat matn va rasmlar','Role settings saved.'=>'Rol sozlamalari saqlandi.','Roles and client mode'=>'Rollar va mijoz rejimi','Choose what each role can do in the builder. Administrators can always do everything. Client mode locks the layout and design, so the role can only change text and images.'=>'Konstruktor uchun har bir rol nima qila olishini tanlang. Administratorlar har doim hamma narsani qila oladi. Mijoz rejimi maket va dizaynni bloklaydi, shuning uchun rol faqat matn va rasmlarni o\'zgartira oladi.','Role'=>'Rol','Save role settings'=>'Rol sozlamalarini saqlash','Saved. Reload the page to see the new names.'=>'Saqlandi. Yangi nomlarni ko\'rish uchun sahifani qayta yuklang.','Rename the builder and hide our branding on this site'=>'Ushbu saytda konstruktorni qayta nomlang va brendimizni yashiring','Shown everywhere the product name appears: menus, the editor, notices.'=>'Mahsulot nomi ko\'rinadigan barcha joylarda: menyularda, muharrirda, bildirishnomalarda ko\'rsatiladi.','Leave empty to use the builder name.'=>'Konstruktor nomidan foydalanish uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Description on the Plugins screen'=>'Plaginlar ekranidagi tavsif','A Dashicons name (for example dashicons-admin-customizer) or an https:// image address.'=>'Dashicons nomi (masalan, dashicons-admin-customizer) yoki https:// tasvir manzili.','Hide the plugin from the Plugins screen'=>'Plaginlar ekranidan plaginni yashirish','Agency users who still see the real product and these settings'=>'Hali ham haqiqiy mahsulotni va ushbu sozlamalarni ko\'radigan agentlik foydalanuvchilari','%d new'=>'%d ta yangi' . "\0" . '%d ta yangi','%d replaced'=>'%d almashtirildi' . "\0" . '%d almashtirildi','%d kept as they were'=>'%d tushib qoldirilmagani kabi saqlab qolindi' . "\0" . '%d tushib qoldirilmagani kabi saqlab qolindi','%d setting'=>'%d ta sozlama' . "\0" . '%d ta sozlama','Importing will give: %s.'=>'Import qilish natijasida quyidagilar olinadi: %s.','Imported: %s.'=>'Import qilindi: %s.','Exported %d item.'=>'%d ta element eksport qilindi.' . "\0" . '%d ta element eksport qilindi.','That file could not be read as an export file.'=>'Bu faylni eksport fayli sifatida o\'qib bo\'lmadi.','Export'=>'Eksport qilish','Download your templates, patterns and site design as one file, to import on another site.'=>'Boshqa saytga import qilish uchun shablonlaringiz, naqshlaringiz va sayt dizayningizni bitta fayl sifatida yuklab oling.','There are no templates or patterns to export yet.'=>'Hali eksport qilish uchun shablonlar yoki naqshlar mavjud emas.','Include the settings'=>'Sozlamalarni kiritish','Download the export file'=>'Eksport faylini yuklab olish','Import'=>'Import qilish','Choose an export file'=>'Eksport faylini tanlang','The file holds %1$d item from %2$s.'=>'Faylda %2$s dan %1$d ta element mavjud.' . "\0" . 'Fayl %2$s dan %1$d ta elementni o\'z ichiga oladi.','When an item with the same name already exists here'=>'Bu yerda shunday nomli element allaqachon mavjud boʻlganda','Keep the one on this site'=>'Ushbu saytdagisini saqlab qolish','Replace it with the imported one'=>'Uni import qilingani bilan almashtiring','Import a copy beside it'=>'Yoniga nusxasini import qilish','Apply the settings in the file'=>'Fayldagi sozlamalarni qo\'llash','Copy the images into this site’s media library'=>'Rasmlarni ushbu saytning media kutubxonasiga nusxalang','Show what will happen'=>'Nima sodir bo\'lishini ko\'rsatish','block titleAlert'=>'Ogohlantirish','block descriptionA notice for your visitors: information, success, a warning or an error, with an optional title and a close button.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilaringiz uchun bildirishnoma: ma\'lumot, muvaffaqiyat, ogohlantirish yoki xatolik, ixtiyoriy sarlavha va yopish tugmasi bilan.','block keywordnotice'=>'Bildirishnoma','block keywordmessage'=>'xabar','block keywordcallout'=>'ogohlantirish','block keywordwarning'=>'ogohlantirish','block titleButton link'=>'Tugma havolasi','block descriptionA link styled as a button.'=>'Tugma ko\'rinishidagi havola.','block keywordbutton'=>'tugma','block keywordlink'=>'havola','block keywordcall to action'=>'Harakatga chaqiruv','block titleColumn'=>'Ustun','block descriptionA column inside a row. It can hold any block.'=>'Qator ichidagi ustun. U istalgan blokni saqlashi mumkin.','block keywordcolumn'=>'ustun','block keywordlayout'=>'tartib','block titleContainer'=>'Konteyner','block descriptionA box that lays out the blocks inside it with flexbox or a grid. Nest containers to build any layout. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Uni flexbox yoki tarmoq (grid) yordamida ichidagi bloklarni joylashtiradigan quti. Istalgan tartibni yaratish uchun konteynerlarni ichma-ich joylashtiring. Plagin o\'chirib qo\'yilgan taqdirda ham o\'qishga yaroqli bo\'lib qoladi.','block keywordcontainer'=>'konteyner','block keywordbox'=>'quti','block keywordgrid'=>'tarmoq','block keywordflexbox'=>'flexbox','block keywordcolumns'=>'ustunлар','block titleLanguage switcher (sample)'=>'Tilni almashtirgich (namuna)','block descriptionLists the site\'s languages from the translation plugin, when one is active. It renders nothing otherwise.'=>'Tarjima Plagini faol bo‘lganda sayt tillarini ro‘yxat ko‘rinishida chiqaradi, aks holda hech narsa ko‘rsatmaydi.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Til','block keywordswitcher'=>'almashtirgich','block titleSample content'=>'Namuna tarkib','block descriptionA heading and a paragraph, rendered with neutral class names. It is the reference block for the translation contract.'=>'Neytral sinf nomlari bilan render qilingan sarlavha va paragraf. Bu tarjima shartnomasi uchun ma\'lumotnoma bloki.','block keywordsample'=>'namuna','block keywordtext'=>'matn','block titleIcon'=>'Nishon','block descriptionAn SVG icon. The markup is cleaned before it is shown.'=>'SVG belgisi. Ko\'rsatilishidan oldin uning markup qismi tozalanadi.','block keywordicon'=>'nishoncha','block keywordsvg'=>'svg','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Tilni o\'zgartirgich','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another language, styled to match your page. Needs the Tranzly plugin for the languages.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilarga bu sahifani boshqa tilda, sahifangiz uslubiga moslashtirilgan holda o\'qish imkonini beradi. Tillar uchun Tranzly plagini talab qilinadi.','block keywordtranslation'=>'tarjima','block keywordmultilingual'=>'ko\'p tilli','block titleDark mode switch'=>'Qorong‘i rejim tugmasi','block descriptionA button that switches the website between its light and dark colours, and remembers the visitor\'s choice.'=>'Veb-saytni ochiq va to‘q ranglar o‘rtasida almashtiradigan hamda tashrif buyuruvchining tanlovini eslab qoladigan tugma.','block keyworddark'=>'to\'q rangli','block keywordlight'=>'Yorqin','block keywordcolour scheme'=>'rang sxemasi','block titleRow'=>'Qator','block descriptionA row of columns. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Ustunlar qatori. Plagin o\'chirib qo\'yilgan taqdirda ham o\'qishga yaroqli bo\'lib qoladi.','block keywordrow'=>'qator','block titleSection'=>'Bo\'lim','block descriptionA full-width band of the page that lays its content out with flexbox or a grid. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Flexbox yoki grid yordamida o‘z tarkibini joylashtiradigan sahifaning to‘liq kenglikdagi tasmasi. Plagin o‘chirib qo‘yilgan taqdirda ham o‘qishga yaroqli bo‘lib qoladi.','block keywordsection'=>'Bo‘lim','block titleShortcode (add-on)'=>'Qisqa kod (qo‘shimcha)','block descriptionA shortcode from an add-on written for the classic Page Builder Sandwich editor, with the settings the add-on declared.'=>'Klassik Page Builder Sandwich muharriri uchun yozilgan qo\'shimcha ilovaning shortkodi, ilova e\'lon qilgan sozlamalar bilan.','block keywordshortcode'=>'shortcode','block keywordadd-on'=>'qo‘shimcha','block titleWidget area'=>'Vidjet maydoni','block descriptionShows the widgets in one of the theme\'s widget areas.'=>'Mavzuning vidjet hududlaridan biridagi vidjetlarni ko\'rsatadi.','block keywordsidebar'=>'yon panel','block keywordwidget area'=>'vidjet maydoni','block titleWidget'=>'Vidjet','block descriptionShows one of the site\'s registered classic widgets.'=>'Saytda ro\'yxatdan o\'tgan klassik vidjetlardan birini ko\'rsatadi.','block keywordwidget'=>'vidjet']];